From bbolker at gmail.com  Thu Feb 10 18:57:55 2011
From: bbolker at gmail.com (Ben Bolker)
Date: Thu, 10 Feb 2011 12:57:55 -0500
Subject: [R-sig-ME] glmer, p-values, and mcmcsamp
In-Reply-To: <4D53BB4F.1020909@bio.ulaval.ca>
References: <4D53B86E.3010601@uit.no> <4D53BB4F.1020909@bio.ulaval.ca>
