From: jwm-r-mixed-models at skepsi.net (Jason Morgan)
Date: Sun, 13 Mar 2011 13:48:25 -0400
Subject: [R-sig-ME] lmer and latex
In-Reply-To: <4D7CFBB6.4050509@gmail.com>
