s2  6 1006.50 1025.8 -497.25 145.256      1  < 2.2e-16 ***
s3 11  991.29 1026.7 -484.65  25.211      5  0.0001268 ***

PPS I can't remember if glmer with gaussian(link="sqrt") works, but it 
does require starting values.



