From: r.turner at auckland.ac.nz (Rolf Turner)
Date: Tue, 8 Feb 2011 10:09:46 +1300
Subject: [R-sig-ME] Logistic regression with spatial autocorrelation
	structure
In-Reply-To: <AANLkTimOQ4xLEa6j9wsKZPwKyV=XCXTd1=dW=tWBWEO0@mail.gmail.com>
References: <20cf305499d9f46c62049bb636e8@google.com>
