> 
> > for resp 3 (reproduction) with the size parameters (i.e. responses  
> 
> > of m1) as covariates. We are interested in a trade-off of growth and 
>  
> > reproduction.
> >
> >
> > Any help would be greatly appreciated.
> >
> > Many thanks,
