> data = otter)
>  > summary(mod1)
> Linear mixed model fit by REML
> Formula: Swiftness.1 ~ Lure + Sex + Facility.Size + (1 | Subject)
>     Data: otter
>    AIC  BIC logLik deviance REMLdev
>   1277 1295 -631.3     1302    1263
> Random effects:
