From Paul.Johnson at glasgow.ac.uk  Mon Feb  7 01:51:08 2011
From: Paul.Johnson at glasgow.ac.uk (Paul Johnson)
Date: Mon, 7 Feb 2011 00:51:08 +0000
Subject: [R-sig-ME] MCMCglmm: ixn between binary family-level factor and
 us() random effect
In-Reply-To: <20110205104918.77421t1dvhxagny8@www.staffmail.ed.ac.uk>
