Well, V2 is the sticking point.  lme is failing when it has to
carry out a "vector" by "matrix" subtraction: y[revOrder] - Fitted,
where y is 1:22(1d) and Fitted is a 22*2 matrix.

z <- as.numeric(tmp$V2)
