Subject: [R-sig-ME] Poisson mixed models: Non-integer response variable
 in lmer?
In-Reply-To: <AANLkTinR=U64kmfnZ5=wsN1HUz9fTqpQeKqFHVi5rjvc@mail.gmail.com>
References: <AANLkTinR=U64kmfnZ5=wsN1HUz9fTqpQeKqFHVi5rjvc@mail.gmail.com>
