This might lead you to something like


fm1 <- lmer(Reaction ~ Days + (Days|Subject), sleepstudy)
hints(fm1)

fm1.results <- list(ran=ranef(fm1), fix=fixef(fm1), vc=VarCorr(fm1))

Also see
?"mer-class" for a complete list of methods for mer objects.

