lme(rrt ~ trialtype*con*wmcz, data = , random = ~ 1|id/wmcz/trialtype/con)

lme(rrt ~ trialtype*con*wmcz, data = , random = ~ 1|id/wmcz)

Is one of these models right for this design? Why? Or why not?

Thanks,
